These are written by the people who do the work, mostly in answer to a question
that came up at the counter more than once. If a piece here saves someone a tow,
it has paid for itself.

The entries live under `/articles` and this index under `/company`, which is the
live site’s arrangement rather than a choice — they were never nested under it,
and moving seven URLs to make them look nested would spend ranking to buy
tidiness.
